    {
      "id": "099c02a9dbcca7fc88ca993733f34012641777636202412d8286bc7bb4928530",
      "text": "AI Engineer Roadmap",
      "hash": "29a768799acab15b5a0ee28f241b6e057d0b5ff706c70c3edf7f24676f3d77a8"
    },
    {
      "id": "ed20a04eb06e68a8eef259f7563b56b2a7798f06554574e7add660e3cb423e1c",
      "text": "AI Coding Dictionary",
      "hash": "4def77f9388809f53620144510fcc4b6f08662617bcc06a15abc618242e6544c"
    },
    {
      "id": "093139eff62ca347f27b0f26b5c25d8c7b9611f5ae2d6ca772b3bd3056f0cc6a",
      "text": "Topics",
      "hash": "e22820fcf5cd90e3fdd99a7569e0ee2f30eb7ebadfb2fe4d159b30c166ff81b7"
    },
    {
      "id": "1433ab0af8cc2521ac2d3f1d2102d0645fb9aca016b86c0420037972dc10338e",
      "text": "The Model",
      "hash": "1954409637324f1c3f2cab102211fd161a6cd1c270252fc2e1297a69ab9a446b"
    },
    {
      "id": "9fe2fb3eee9382bfe64b278c449899465e16dd3e8eb2eb90ffc64d346433dacc",
      "text": "A moving label, not a technology. Points at whatever computers can newly, impressively do — right now, large language models.",
      "hash": "ae5d29315873870b0fc18dfc2e6ecd51b5a5be1653332ca424c6e168f9cd94a9"
    },
    {
      "id": "f5219ec79e5ddbf5bae8edee889fc21e0eef1e28923e69476f84a905755a47ce",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "398dafd564a3efa818d39be34db6682ff3906fcdbf62db2839e242699d8055a3",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "20f93b233edb3243822bd9ae4c29260e8862b8bec94ca8f33ef4a46fcdd052c2",
      "text": "A moving label, not a technology. \"AI\" doesn't name a fixed thing the way",
      "hash": "878b4b38ca1b2a775fe14d1e3bac0de973fb5f406a9e7605b21eed32f1507716"
    },
    {
      "id": "f9953c36e245b1d0dfffbfaa6e8c001f7463a44e3ab785df77407857af5448f4",
      "text": "does — it points at whatever computers can newly, impressively do. Right now it points at large language models. It has pointed at very different things before:",
      "hash": "a98839b4fd2dfba564c2be27e54d51855242069760fbc5f3d5a6b274bfe6085b"
    },
    {
      "id": "23c211769ccbc726fff44f1f3744de5c92e6a164eb5aeb4aad11690cadd6cf66",
      "text": "Era",
      "hash": "60c87e4af6d35736397482f8e47d6d480213fd37d2caca8d7952fa79e1f35fc0"
    },
    {
      "id": "26b0bf7eea00c896601158a8766bacfaee92dddccc4eb196ce00410b820238e1",
      "text": "What \"AI\" meant",
      "hash": "bc504b66b4709728d962b451a02ccc726bfd963d6ef25169159e7c6b7aa0ddc1"
    },
    {
      "id": "20a8e50ffdfc62a69350bfb67c6d0571d19a282319b35128f1b2d2c8c863f644",
      "text": "Symbolic reasoning — theorem provers, checkers programs.",
      "hash": "0ec1fcde6e5742222f6775bbce7ab1c0469f4f3f89f68f951dab2c747317c9eb"
    },
    {
      "id": "83de96c5915399f75e52290e610f6ac5c0f38200b61ff74afc8b260644e6a00d",
      "text": "1960s–70s",
      "hash": "3e3eaed8e056395536ebc5e20f1673ae6ec60b457c7b9be303fa00050ddd2fa3"
    },
    {
      "id": "112f555553e7ef1702fba9d21bd29847ab336d2a89244d9a2869d5a7740843bd",
      "text": "Rule-based symbolic programs — ELIZA, SHRDLU.",
      "hash": "24cfbc4fb459a4848f395aedfaa4e85460d8073563e58094fd922d40865b42f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "a4c87a914a645a732f2b9623e7c47df1a56e3860812b7991b78b48ddb75b37a1",
      "text": "Expert systems — thousands of hand-written if-then rules encoding human expertise.",
      "hash": "4fb7ca9ac5045cd30e56846fe9f563dcfc4412f6c49f47dc59c30ba591929b96"
    },
    {
      "id": "dc1ad9ba0879b2a335a55b29956e82b7847b1e6f730ebe4d7117491f6a48a675",
      "text": "Game-tree search — Deep Blue beating Kasparov (1997). Researchers avoided the word \"AI\" entirely",
      "hash": "97526f7bc295682519124757569c461bd7dfe870614f22034f2d1a1cb7df9135"
    },
    {
      "id": "4e34aa326b198fe8c4ee2344e73532c9dd09c088baa42e1152755ea76ebab647",
      "text": "Statistical machine learning — spam filters, recommenders. Still sold as \"machine learning\", not \"AI\"",
      "hash": "6a8b2b6e112114d3d3921d9317faf117d3135981d70c4db0455e698fe9acf47c"
    },
    {
      "id": "06d1cf3cb979c4a731291ce4f0f2f1a6cd984bac813a96cf6a432b0b8e9e5176",
      "text": "Deep learning — image recognition (AlexNet, 2012), AlphaGo (2016).",
      "hash": "562b19f465ffee5b6403c697246502e59d56dd1a549c2635e2da782d4da41804"
    },
    {
      "id": "d907715be5b04bc1644f0cb07c8dd3584898b5ca9d616aec60e30698b5afa099",
      "text": "Large language models — ChatGPT (2022) made \"AI\" mean chatbots",
      "hash": "7d79407058b1db4a56f9afc48bc88a152398c5e65a0f8fe10af4414719837f47"
    },
    {
      "id": "ad5b918d576a343ec0dc0825b87df0c296ef5b1529b9a16382257f6f1995f2e7",
      "text": "View Table",
      "hash": "aa0a0f6baf57a603925533ee10fab7f6bb4e7002e7d8df106b2bc671e1d72567"
    },
    {
      "id": "f277beffa0ea1909977b0eedeb001426c4bda7a8afcfafaf3594e2594b924dff",
      "text": "The pointer moves by a known mechanism, sometimes called the AI effect: once a technique works reliably, it gets renamed — it's \"just\" search, \"just\" statistics — and \"AI\" slides forward to the next unsolved thing. The observation is old. Bertram Raphael put it this way in 1971: \"AI is a collective name for problems which we do not yet know how to solve properly by computer.\" Larry Tesler's version, from around 1979: \"Intelligence is whatever machines haven't done yet.\"",
      "hash": "9d5b089d5db1b73c41aa5f6b5bf7fa9960cc93a15f432b6ade405c5d03368c94"
    },
    {
      "id": "9c0d486693f3df7a1170195e0ecb3de894f12ef95fdc9156525c5fc848bae60d",
      "text": "This is why conversations about AI so often talk past each other. A claim like \"AI can't reason\" or \"AI is overhyped\" carries a hidden timestamp — it may be about expert systems, about 2010s image classifiers, or about last month's LLM, and each reference supports a different conclusion. When a discussion about AI stalls, the fix is usually to swap the word for whichever precise term is actually meant: the model, the",
      "hash": "4abdc88209b7fe3141ad722926fd6e1ceb4c17abfc63d92fc1d1a14b26ee458a"
    },
    {
      "id": "b1f37a8b7205ebfb19ac174a7a7b2150b3d270087bb465a5d149a1f45e9901a7",
      "text": ", the",
      "hash": "3538a0b69856ece9aeb2961477bc2a6bbded4578906bc2df63533cdfa17b2bc4"
    },
    {
      "id": "ce6cfd6134a05c2a51a512a22dc978fa1aa12952d9fc17211d3cef89efb5845a",
      "text": "it was given.",
      "hash": "8619fd1b9f0f716445cbc38a1f962b57c4650d70cb6917332e53b62694f038a0"
    },
    {
      "id": "8a8b40f6d63a266a2fe3edc6a7f59e58f722d2e201cdc0a8fc4174d4f75f95f4",
      "text": "Avoid:",
      "hash": "0c98d3dd1920fdb71269240ba1ce3a7323099760ecd0b295f071aca6b07e30df"
    },
    {
      "id": "c234b03eb7ac746c4b0b192fa238c8184f5785c5c5ec449cc1ba26907b5bc4a5",
      "text": "\"AI\" in any technical claim — name the part you mean instead. \"AI coding\" as a label for the practice is fine; \"the AI is hallucinating\" is not.",
      "hash": "4835bdafc67f205cf474cae021ef7203d12001cc316356a68e2d230e9d67240f"
    },
    {
      "id": "d5fe2fcb3665219e299e013aedc3dfd3ff3917a54e8d1553280fa4c70378c4b1",
      "text": "Usage:",
      "hash": "2bad3eeaf33caffe3bc9b482b4934ed19eb4ec3614c12373e1a5c5f8948217da"
    },
    {
      "id": "aa3cc6be0ad7802f478479c0c886d5217c535b2ec944279764d1c2a7b8eee3eb",
      "text": "\"The CTO wants to know whether AI could handle the triage queue.\"",
      "hash": "630a9c1d35a3b29d002a528f4122dce590c4a4583611ebd9d65781d2d70b8295"
    },
    {
      "id": "28315275c7fa15f4ed4f625258870b86966f4f50fd4a6abb8d8df7f1d986a3b0",
      "text": "\"Translate that before scoping it — she means an LLM in a harness with access to the ticket system. 'AI' on its own isn't a spec.\"",
      "hash": "5870a606cede13043977606765e70192368f6cdb203f48737ba7e989dc6743c7"
    },
    {
      "id": "31f24489025eb2b662015e4d0bda19bd8a1752e0cf8e00e5ebed06f9bc0e17ff",
      "text": "Next term",
      "hash": "5219c7ebdc0e098aa6db6f09e405c1b17ab75f1082862906a872e10a16818f9e"
    },
    {
      "id": "fff8bac065c06abb2b059f89b285627a51ba78f1b0d4d7d42131829f04bda8ec",
      "text": "Model",
      "hash": "5e2c614c23f02239bc03c6c04fcb681950f9e72bf8fdff6be79c79841cbb10c0"
    },
    {
      "id": "32b53d7fa267ab5738090f58a643fffddf2975ccc2c987bb1f831510dc71f98c",
      "text": "Want more than vocabulary?",
      "hash": "5d5500a083006a1606e84a03c018904d01364631c6baea4c7a3f8f3f62bf94dc"
    },
    {
